# Learning a move in battle. Piplup L31 one exp point short of
# L32 (medium slow: 27021) knows four moves; Bubble knocks out the wild Pokémon on Route 202, Piplup grows
# to L32 and wants Whirlpool: "Make it forget another move?" YES, then Growl (slot 2) is forgotten for it.
# After the battle Piplup (L32) evolves into Prinplup (the waits play the scene, `evolve auto`).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 31 platinum:MOVE_POUND platinum:MOVE_GROWL platinum:MOVE_BUBBLE platinum:MOVE_PECK
set state party[0].exp 27020
set var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_202 178 827 up
until idle
+0 evolve auto
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
until battle 900
+0 battle move 3
until battle 3000
+0 battle answer yes
until battle 3000
+0 screenshot learn-move
+0 battle forget 2
until battle end 3000
+0 assert battle wild * won
+0 assert state party[0].level 32
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_POUND","platinum:MOVE_WHIRLPOOL","platinum:MOVE_BUBBLE","platinum:MOVE_PECK"]
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].species "platinum:SPECIES_PRINPLUP"
+0 reload
until idle
